  partName: Right Center Exhaust Manifold Stud
  description: The Right Center Exhaust Manifold Stud is a tiny, elongated stud positioned
    at the top-right-center of the engine, made of Material.001, which serves as
    a threaded fastener for the exhaust manifold, providing a secure attachment point
    for the bolt. This stud is essential for ensuring a stable and leak-free exhaust
    system. Interestingly, its stud design enables easy bolt removal and replacement.
